 "lines": [
  "I <b>heard</b> about a high <b>school</b> in Chi<b>ca</b>go",
  "where <b>stu</b>dents had to <b>pass</b> a <b>cer</b>tain <b>num</b>ber of <b>cours</b>es to <b>grad</b>uate,",
  "and if they <b>did</b>n't pass a <b>course</b>, / they got the <b>grade</b> “Not <b>Yet</b>.”",
  "And I <b>thought</b> that was fan<b>tas</b>tic,",
  "be<b>cause</b> if you get a <b>fail</b>ing grade, / you <b>think</b>, / I'm <b>noth</b>ing, / I'm no<b>where</b>.",
  "But if you get the <b>grade</b> “Not <b>Yet</b>,”",
  "you under<b>stand</b> that you're on a <b>learn</b>ing <b>curve</b>.",
  "It <b>gives</b> you a <b>path</b> into the <b>fu</b>ture.",
  "“Not <b>Yet</b>” also <b>gave</b> me <b>in</b>sight",
  "into a <b>crit</b>ical e<b>vent</b> early in my ca<b>reer</b>,",
  "a <b>real</b> turning <b>point</b>.",
  "I <b>want</b>ed to <b>see</b>",
  "how <b>chil</b>dren <b>coped</b> with <b>chall</b>enge and <b>dif</b>ficulty,",
